@murray.senate.gov THANK YOU!!

The first birth control pill was approved by the FDA in 1960! Reliable control of timing pregnancy underpins the economic & social progress that was a fact of my life since I was a toddler.
I'll spend my retirement making sure we keep our rights to access & privacy.

From a desperate parent’s heart, I beg you, please consider giving 5 dollars. Small donations come together to create life saving treatment. Your kindness truly matters.

